{"w":2400,"lines":[{"c":1,"w":0.12639920552571615,"h":0.017403402681289148,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.075887145019878796,"y":0.037626290629185211},{"t":"GREG: That's what the women thought, and that made them nervous, so they did get poor","x":0.074226806382494417,"y":0.087199060479446366,"h":0.013211978860833806,"w":0.76082473754882807,"c":1},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"results. But actually they were wrong.... No one was making any assumptions about.","x":0.12989691183778707,"y":0.10305343512485332,"c":1,"w":0.72164947509765631},{"y":0.11918604655536724,"t":"the female students at all.","c":1,"w":0.22061856587727863,"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.12989690253712799},{"y":0.13808139546483922,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"t":"LISA:","w":0.037113402684529631,"c":1,"x":0.072164948039178486},{"x":0.12776945209918117,"w":0.71560434977213538,"c":1,"h":0.019519960467281994,"y":0.13190245708539894,"t":"Anyway, what Miyake's team did was quite simple - getting the students to do some"},{"t":"writing before they went into the physics class. What did they call it?","h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.12989690580716029,"c":1,"w":0.57731959025065105,"y":0.15116279074703498},{"c":1,"y":0.16559013486895247,"t":"GREG: Values-affirmation - they had to write an essay focusing on things that were significant","x":0.072164970746684196,"w":0.7958762613932292,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"c":1,"w":0.71351064046223955,"y":0.18255115996888804,"t":"to them, not panicularly to do with the subject they were studying, but more general","x":0.12777658384111551,"h":0.015699889473682727},{"x":0.12783505102087639,"h":0.013211978860833917,"w":0.43092783610026048,"y":0.20052847895173653,"c":1,"t":"things like music, or people who mattered to them."},{"t":"LISA:","x":0.070103092369075387,"y":0.21802325559932922,"w":0.037113402684529617,"h":0.011627907341393184,"c":1},{"t":"Right. So the idea of doing the writing is that this gets the students thinking in a","x":0.12989690423488354,"h":0.015988371754420583,"y":0.21511627923625387,"w":0.67010309855143235,"c":1},{"x":0.12981041603143731,"t":"positive way.","y":0.23222833279378641,"w":0.10945133209228516,"h":0.015194496965660331,"c":1},{"x":0.072164937083854852,"w":0.76494847615559891,"c":1,"y":0.24854651179484311,"t":"GREG: And putting these thoughts into words can relax them and help them overcome the.","h":0.015988371754420694},{"w":0.7154639180501301,"x":0.12783505274469426,"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"psychological factors that lead to poor performance. Yeah. But what the researchers","y":0.26306517889645042,"c":1},{"w":0.70126520792643232,"x":0.12773564938672025,"h":0.018798879644692956,"t":"in the study hadn't expected was that this one activity raised the women's physics","y":0.27776528159591418,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.2865979258219401,"t":"grades from the C to the B range.","x":0.12989691327588559,"y":0.2965116279499852,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"y":0.31540697686018815,"w":0.035051546096801764,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"x":0.072164948491547559,"t":"LISA:"},{"x":0.12783504251667363,"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.72577321370442716,"c":1,"y":0.31238990022592317,"t":"A huge change. Pity it wasn't to an A, but still! No, but it does suggest that the women"},{"t":"were seriously underperforming beforehand, in comparison with the men.","h":0.014534883616744931,"y":0.32848837214179749,"w":0.62268040974934891,"x":0.12783505276501861,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.75688130696614586,"x":0.072069802735583055,"y":0.34103192833184126,"h":0.020147731285968806,"t":"GREG: Yes. Mind you, Miyake's article left out a lot of details. Like, did the students do the"},{"t":"writing just once, or several times? And had they been told why they were ding the","y":0.35826119953316649,"c":1,"x":0.12772931321738137,"h":0.018958689252278838,"w":0.71155181884765628},{"w":0.37938143412272129,"x":0.12783505604882814,"t":"writing? That might have affected the resuts","c":1,"y":0.37639459749043769,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"w":0.039175256093343089,"y":0.39389534909860235,"c":1,"t":"LISA:","x":0.068041237829617116,"h":0.011627906221399864},{"y":0.39092546250567106,"w":0.70733322143554689,"x":0.12777649438899355,"t":"You mean, if they know the researchers thought it might help them to improve, then","h":0.017641139744452361,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.32783505757649739,"t":"they'd just try to fulfil that expectation?","x":0.12783504843025451,"y":0.40839694640388824,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"y":0.42441860467297443,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"GREG: Exactly.","x":0.070103096109098997,"c":1,"w":0.12783504486083985},{"x":0.072164958058876419,"w":0.7278350321451823,"y":0.46506165604209948,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"GREG: So anyway, I thought for our project we could do a similar study, but investigate","c":1},{"w":0.50515462239583331,"t":"whether it really was the writing activity that had that result.","x":0.12577320416556281,"c":1,"y":0.48110465121176427,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"t":"OK. So we could ask.them to do a writing task about something completely different .","w":0.72989690144856767,"x":0.12371134297937242,"c":1,"y":0.49706400483859048,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"something more factual? Like a general knowledge topic.","x":0.12783504488991024,"w":0.48659795125325522,"c":1,"y":0.51308139539714481,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"y":0.52906635375193833,"w":0.73402064005533862,"h":0.014679976512037674,"x":0.070103081934440759,"c":1,"t":"GREG: Maybe... or we could have half the students doing a writing task and half doing"},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.54492072815935733,"c":1,"t":"something else, like an oral task.","x":0.12577319015493327,"w":0.28247423807779948},{"y":0.55965413112320317,"c":1,"x":0.11953841191410182,"t":"Or even, half do the same writing task as in the original research and half do a","w":0.67636678059895827,"h":0.017594128584623725},{"t":"factual writing task. Then we'd see if it really is the topic that made the difference, or","y":0.57569254443138662,"c":1,"x":0.12777825994936184,"h":0.017406219464501937,"w":0.71350219726562503},{"c":1,"x":0.1278350539004445,"t":"something eise","w":0.13195875803629556,"h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.59447674421307906},{"x":0.070103080101643039,"c":1,"t":"GREG: That's it. Good. So at our meeting with the supervisor on Monday we can tell him","y":0.60892542554751938,"w":0.74226806640624998,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"t":"we've decided on our project. We should have our aims ready by then. I suppose we","c":1,"w":0.71764536539713542,"x":0.12777174124603238,"y":0.62471986111652078,"h":0.016320973932218097},{"x":0.12989691367291825,"c":1,"w":0.51340204874674489,"t":"need to read the original study - the article's just a summary.","h":0.014679976512037674,"y":0.6409277743391345},{"x":0.070103092375139675,"t":"LISA:","w":0.037113402684529617,"c":1,"y":0.65988372104783777,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"h":0.018681922101722481,"c":1,"w":0.7258890787760417,"y":0.65529511613323821,"t":"And there was another article I read, by Smolinsky. It was about her research on how","x":0.12365149410903636},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"women and men perform in mixed teams in class, compared with single-sex teams","y":0.67293012325545998,"c":1,"x":0.12783504124365824,"w":0.70309280395507812},{"x":0.1255883619994082,"w":0.15096181233723954,"h":0.014056753986244397,"c":1,"t":"and on their own.","y":0.68956175211335136},{"c":1,"t":"GREG:","w":0.055670102437337235,"x":0.070103093008135511,"y":0.70784883745092442,"h":0.010174418083723991},{"y":0.70639534865221776,"h":0.011749102379109533,"c":1,"t":"Let me guess... the women were better at teamwork.","x":0.12371134587054702,"w":0.45979380289713545},{"x":0.070103092354347848,"h":0.0087209299460481171,"c":1,"y":0.72529069778652733,"w":0.037113402684529617,"t":"LISA:"},{"h":0.016468321374074391,"c":1,"t":"That's what I expected, but actually the men and the women got the same results","w":0.68876332600911461,"y":0.72088540004093571,"x":0.127784102542086},{"x":0.12577320731116023,"c":1,"t":"whether they were working in teams or on their own. But I guess it's not that relevant","w":0.71958760579427083,"h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.73837209307322349},{"y":0.75513851622037798,"h":0.010242213519684906,"c":1,"w":0.050367752710978195,"t":"to us.","x":0.1232626257356665},{"c":1,"t":"GREG: What worries me anyway is how we're going to get everything done in the time.","x":0.065979409617194076,"h":0.015988371754420583,"w":0.73195871988932293,"y":0.76889534880665589},{"h":0.011627906221399864,"x":0.063917526489410917,"w":0.039175256093343103,"y":0.7877906979358118,"c":1,"t":"LISA:"},{"y":0.78358889645954399,"t":"We'll be OK now we know what we're doing. Though I'm not clear how we assess","w":0.69299362182617186,"h":0.018710098893797822,"x":0.12359946220420227,"c":1},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"whether the students in our experiment actually make any progress or not...","w":0.65154637654622394,"y":0.80232558144499455,"c":1,"x":0.12164949203443068},{"c":1,"x":0.063917533018137268,"t":"GREG: No. We may need some advice on that. The main thing's to make sure we have the","w":0.76701029459635417,"h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.81826189064858657},{"x":0.12371135340305178,"y":0.83284883707970903,"w":0.35876286824544268,"t":"right size sample, not too big or too small.","h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.011627907341393184,"y":0.85174418576728805,"t":"LISA:","x":0.0639175264722288,"w":0.039175256093343103},{"c":1,"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"That shouldn't be difficult. Right, what do we need to do next? We could have a","x":0.11958763085280452,"w":0.67628865559895834,"y":0.85026423956178709},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"x":0.12164948600339159,"t":"look at the timetable for the science classes... or perhaps we should just make an","w":0.70721649169921874,"y":0.86627906981718272},{"t":"appointment to see one of the science professors. That'd be better.","c":1,"w":0.56701029459635421,"x":0.12371134750327385,"y":0.88226658847315798,"h":0.014679976512037674},{"c":1,"w":0.57319585164388021,"y":0.89812096288556154,"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"GREG: Great. And we could even get to observe one of the classes.","x":0.063917537980456601},{"w":0.037113402684529617,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"t":"LISA:","x":0.065979381028869216,"y":0.91715116290972776},{"w":0.092977587381998697,"c":1,"x":0.11536687631698696,"y":0.91389372437296279,"h":0.013782318661791026,"t":"What for?"},{"c":1,"t":"GREG: Well ... OK maybe let's just go with your idea. Right, well ...","x":0.065979370073167301,"y":0.93012331191647879,"w":0.56494847615559896,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"y":0.94767441850106049,"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"106","x":0.063917526489410931,"w":0.039175256093343103,"c":1},{"w":0.29379859924316409,"x":0.35206821434163693,"y":0.95184192158160008,"h":0.02519279833898358,"t":"leltsresources.org","c":1},{"y":0.10174418581787825,"w":0.037113402684529562,"h":0.013081395479069058,"c":1,"t":"Q23","x":0.87628865912165266},{"t":"Q25","h":0.013081395479069058,"x":0.8762886605100294,"y":0.24709302315222337,"w":0.039175256093343158,"c":1},{"t":"Q26","x":0.87422680484565374,"y":0.26453488361947719,"w":0.039175256093343158,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q27","x":0.87422680484636961,"w":0.039175256093343047,"h":0.013081395479069058,"y":0.3590116278009815},{"w":0.039175256093343047,"c":1,"x":0.87422680484636961,"y":0.56104651152191176,"t":"Q28","h":0.013081395479068947},{"w":0.037113402684529673,"c":1,"t":"Q29","x":0.87422680401856001,"y":0.71947674395741301,"h":0.013081395479069058},{"x":0.87010309349399284,"t":"Q30","y":0.86627906966598878,"w":0.039175256093343047,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1}],"h":3406}